# Minimum supported versions, tested by the `minimum` job in pytest.yml on
# Python 3.10 (the lowest requires-python). Maintained by hand.
#
# Section 1 must match the floors in pyproject.toml [project].dependencies
# exactly (tests/test_dependency_floors.py). Section 2 is the test tooling
# the suite needs, at the dev-extra floors.
#
# Regenerate the hashed lock with:
#   uv pip compile ci/requirements-min.in --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.10 -o ci/requirements-min.txt

